<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">服务师工作台</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">接单 · 履约 · 留痕 · 结算</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="field">
      <view class="field-label">开发登录标识（dev 环境固定字符串，如 dev-provider-1）</view>
      <input class="input" placeholder="留空默认 dev-provider-1" value="{{devCode}}" bindinput="onCodeInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="btn btn-primary {{logging ? 'btn-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="login">登录工作台</view>
  </view>

  <view class="muted" style="text-align:center;margin-top:40rpx">
    生产环境将替换为微信一键登录
  </view>
</view>
